## 📋 QUICK DECISION TREE

```
Does this involve MORE THAN ONE file?
├─ YES → Use Antigravity
└─ NO → Continue...

Is this a DESIGN DECISION?
├─ YES → Use Antigravity
└─ NO → Continue...

Is this BOILERPLATE or SIMPLE PATTERN?
├─ YES → Use GitHub Agent ✅
└─ NO → Use Antigravity
```

---

## 📝 READY-TO-USE PROMPT: LotusButton

```
Create src/components/LotusButton.tsx

A reusable button component.

Props:
interface LotusButtonProps {
  title: string;
  onPress: () => void;
  variant?: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'ghost';
  loading?: boolean;
  disabled?: boolean;
}

Styling:
- primary: background Theme.colors.sanctuarySaffron, text white
- secondary: transparent background, border sanctuarySaffron
- ghost: transparent, text dimGray
- borderRadius: Theme.corners.comfortable
- padding: Theme.spacing.md

Features:
- On press: call hapticLight() from '../utils/haptics'
- If loading: show spinner, disable button
- If disabled: opacity 0.5

Import: Pressable, Text, Theme, hapticLight

Export as default.
```

---

