**Design with me (FREE) → Build components with GitHub Agent (CHEAP) → Integrate with me (FREE)**

**Use GitHub Agent for**: 20% of work (simple components)  
**Use Antigravity for**: 80% of work (architecture + integration)  
**Result**: 80% cost savings + better quality

